# Today's Telecommunications in Secretarial Programs.

**Authors:** Smith, Dianna L.

## Abstract
Students need to become familiar with the new telephone features and techniques which are used in the office. These include call detail recording, call park, call waiting, direct outward (and inward) dialing, and route optimization. (CT)

